# DIBAY OVERLAY HARD LOCK

1. New app-owned modal MUST use DIBAY Overlay SSOT (`components/ui/dibay-overlay` + `app/dibay-overlay.css`).
2. New `window.alert` / `confirm` / `prompt` is prohibited for app-owned UX.
3. Feature-local modal visual systems are prohibited.
4. Bottom sheets on bottom-nav routes MUST use `MAIN_BOTTOM_NAV_SHEET_*` geometry (not magic `bottom: 60px`).
5. Overlay typography / colors / radius / backdrop MUST use `--overlay-*` tokens from the Overlay Design System attachment.
6. Overlay action buttons MUST use `dibay-overlay-btn` roles (primary / secondary / destructive / text).
7. Overlay pressed state MUST use scale 0.98 (shared).
8. OS-owned prompts remain native (CallKit, mic/cam, APNs, browser permission).
9. Business authority MUST NOT move into overlay components.
10. Forbidden in outgoing call confirm: `#007AFF`.
